      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "https://leafcoin.org/#concept",
      "url": "https://leafcoin.org/",
      "name": "Leafcoin — A concept for verifiable agriculture",
      "description": "Leafcoin is a personal agrotech R&D concept by Ilya Papou, exploring aeroponics, IoT telemetry, ML-assisted calibration and verifiable production records. Besu with QBFT is being considered for a permissioned EVM network in the proposed architecture.",
